    q_insert --> [*]: member designated as team leader

    note right of q_validate_team
        INV-001: (team_id, member_id) is composite PRIMARY KEY
        INV-002: team_id REFERENCES member.teams ON DELETE CASCADE
        INV-003: member_id REFERENCES member.members ON DELETE CASCADE
        INV-004: Multiple leaders per team allowed (no UNIQUE on team_id alone)
